   fault:   latte$entry.BadlyNamed is annotated @actions(name: "not a name"); an action group's name reaches a URL path, so it is letters, digits, '-' and '_'
   control: (quiet)
ok   a-group-name-a-url-cannot-carry: the exact fault: latte$entry.BadlyNamed is annotated @actions(name: "not a name"); an action group's name reaches a URL path, so it is letters, digits, '-' and '_'
ok   a-group-name-a-url-cannot-carry: the control is quiet: (quiet)
